## 8. 📋 Artifacts & Task Management — "Work Tracking"

Some agent frameworks include built-in task tracking:

| Artifact | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `task.md` | Living checklist of work items (`[ ]`, `[/]`, `[x]`) |
| `implementation_plan.md` | Technical design doc for approval before coding |
| `walkthrough.md` | Post-completion summary with proof of work |

### Example `task.md`

```markdown
- [x] Research existing authentication flow
- [x] Plan JWT token rotation strategy
- [/] Implement refresh token endpoint
  - [x] Create `/auth/refresh` route
  - [ ] Add rate limiting
  - [ ] Write integration tests
- [ ] Update API documentation
```

