## 10. ⚡ Advanced Optimizations

### Prompt Caching
Reuse previously computed prompt prefixes to save cost & latency:
- **OpenAI**: Automatic prefix caching (up to 90% cost savings)
- **Anthropic**: Explicit cache breakpoints in Claude

### Tiered Injection
Load only task-relevant instruction subsets instead of monolithic files:
- Reduces context by 60-80%
- Prevents the "bloated prompt" problem

