## 🎯 Where to Start? (Prioritized)

1. **Create `AGENTS.md`** — Universal, works with every tool, highest impact
2. **Add tool-specific rules** — `.cursorrules` or `CLAUDE.md` depending on your tool
3. **Set up MCP servers** — Connect your agent to GitHub, databases, etc.
4. **Create workflows** — For your most repeated tasks (deploy, test, release)
5. **Add skills** — For complex, multi-step procedures unique to your project

---

> [!NOTE]
> This landscape is evolving **fast**. Many of these standards emerged in late 2025 and are still maturing. The trend is toward **convergence** — `AGENTS.md` as the universal standard, `SKILL.md` as the skill standard, and MCP as the connectivity standard.
